@ Start

// See MelodiaQuillPetalPriestess.qsc -- the background box renders blank until a
// script sets an image. CosmicOrrery is the star-weaver counterpart to that grove.
$ Background {&/Game/Melodia/UI/Textures/Figma/T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_CosmicOrrery.T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_CosmicOrrery} none 0

? if: {melodia_q_echo_02_complete} == on

  - Star Weaver
    The grove remembers your rhythm. Follow the path that has opened beyond the lanterns.

? else:

  ? if: {melodia_q_echo_01_complete} == on

    - Star Weaver
      I felt the Crystal Shard yield. You did not silence the echo—you taught it to listen.

    - Star Weaver
      The path forward is answering now. Take its cadence toward morning.

    $ Notify melodia:quest:melodia_q_echo_02

  ? else:

    - Star Weaver
      A first echo still waits in the grove. Speak with the Petal Priestess, then follow the lantern-song.

  ? endif

? endif

$ End
